<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69754" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάρκ-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>numbness, deadness</i>, caused by
			palsy, frost, fright, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aph.</u>
				5.25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. κατὰ τῆς χειρὸς καταχεῖται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					713
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				515b20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				867b29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				954a23
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>torpedo, electric ray</i>, which <i>benumbs</i> any one who
			touches it, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				132.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anaxandr.
				41.52
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ πλατεῖα ν. ἡ θαλαττία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Men.</u>
					80a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				620b19
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. ποταμία</span> the Egyptian
				<i>electric eel, Malapterurus electricus, PMag.Osl.</i><i><span class="en">
				1.284
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.312b
			</span></i>: in metapl. acc. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάρκᾰ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					3.55
				</span></i>
			.</div>
